e a short, controlled camera shake. Simultaneous saves no longer collide over a shared temporary file. A hat indic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:03:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691533","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4854220-1846651706685493","game_id":"steam-4854220","kind":"update","title":"Demo & beta update — graphics, controls and feedback","summary":"Beta update — October 10, 2026 (build 25853611) Fixed unintended brightness, graphics quality, render scale and resolution resets when loading saves without valid graphics settings, including when opening the shop after level results. Damaged settings recover without clearing progress. Added an adjustable mouse aiming pointer: 75%, 100%, 125%, 150% and 200%, available in Controls from the main and pause menus. Your selection is saved between sessions. In-game feedback supports up to three image ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T19:55:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685493","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4854220-1845383656389499","game_id":"steam-4854220","kind":"announcement","title":"Stick Crisis 0.17.0-beta — New scenery and Inspector improvements","summary":"Refreshed scenery and cover A richer military Tutorial with character-scale buildings, new crates and sandbags. Street brings back detailed New York night streets and refreshed cover. Jungle adds ground vegetation, clearer visual hierarchy, and refined crates and logs. Desert features new scenery and sandbag, rock and jeep artwork. Cover positions and navigation match the obstacles; fixed background variety across connected phases. New level-selector previews captured from real gameplay. Inspect","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T16:16:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389499","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4854220-1844751498222445","game_id":"steam-4854220","kind":"announcement","title":"Stick Crisis — Save slots, controller options and demo improvements","summary":"Full game• Manage multiple save slots from the menu.• Configure gamepad aim assist in Options.• Hold PLAY to start, with a hint when released early.• New weapon, ability, and achievement art, plus clearer purchase feedback.• Updated level previews, a Cover icon matching the equipped character, and backgrounds for wider displays.• Cover durability now progresses by level. Fixes to returning to the menu, erasing progress, navigating Options, and pausing.Steam demo• The ending plays the full traile","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T19:02:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498222445","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4854220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:44Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:44Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4854220":"2026-10-26T04:46:44Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4854220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5164510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4854220","app_id":4854220,"app_scope":"base","observed_a